($q$Chinese Government Scholarship for Ghanaian Students$q$,$q$Government of China (China Scholarship Council) via Ghana Scholarships Authority$q$,$q$China$q$,$q$Not stated$q$,$q$Postgraduate$q$,$q$For Ghanaian citizens resident in Ghana. Master's: at least Second Class Upper, age 35 or under. PhD: Second Class Upper plus a relevant Master's, age 40 or under. Apply online to the China Scholarship Council and send documents to the Ghana Scholarships Secretariat.$q$,NULL::date,$q$https://scholarships.gov.gh/opportunities/chinese-government-scholarship-awards-to-ghanaian-students-for-20262027-academic-year$q$,$q$Benefits not described on the notice$q$),
